[{"title":"内阁五月莲花盛开和太子太保刘公韵二首 其二","author":"李东阳","text":"天与灵姿绝代清，看渠直作水中英。\n云端别有栽培地，江上空多采掇情。\n总是丹青终属幻，未经题品若为荣。\n他年自许归来乐，不结陶翁社里盟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23422,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"内阁五月莲花盛开奉和少傅徐公韵二首 其一","author":"李东阳","text":"漫道西湖百亩宽，新花尚怯晓波寒。\n内园自合先芳意，道眼从来是别观。\n金掌溢时清露委，水仙多处绿云攒。\n人间不解真颜色，却爱红妆舞翠盘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23423,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"内阁五月莲花盛开奉和少傅徐公韵二首 其二","author":"李东阳","text":"两池风物许平分，新赏从来是旧闻。\n空翠欲沾衣上雨，朵红犹识殿东云。\n吟馀綵笔诗难就，宴出芳筒酒易醺。\n红杏碧桃今在否，试将消息问东君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23424,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"并?莲花","author":"沈周","text":"耶溪新绿露娇痴，两面红妆倚一枝。\n水月精魂同结愿，风花情性合相思。\n赵家阿妹春眠起，杨氏诸姨晚浴时。\n今日六郎憔悴尽，为渠还赋断肠诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23425,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芙蕖","author":"陆树声","text":"芙蕖香霭水云多，览胜新从学士过。\n红艳晴薰霞作锦，冰绡寒伴玉为河。\n如翻堕珥依仙渚，若浣明妆出素波。\n欲采芳华劳远赠，秋风其奈独看何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23426,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"莲花","author":"张祥鸢","text":"梅雨丝丝草阁凉，匡床玄坐漫㷊香。\n四檐绿树繁阴合，一卷黄庭白昼长。\n细和禽言成乐府，宽裁荷叶制衣裳。\n笑看溪水明于玉，新水朝添一尺长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23427,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芙蓉","author":"孙慎行","text":"一天霞采正流虹，出水芙蕖欲吐红。\n纵是连宵困寒雨，终然危干独凌风。\n乾坤尚郁胚胎里，身世都忘水玉中。\n慎尔芳馨良自爱，晴光早晚总天功。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23428,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖上赏莲","author":"张虚庵","text":"湖上峰稠乱晚晴，每逢佳处问山名。\n偶因寺好频停舫，贪为波澄不记觥。\n斜抱连环千嶂合，平分双镜六桥横。\n更堪岁晏芙蓉冷，水国西风日夜清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23429,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芙蓉","author":"姚子云","text":"东山未许谢公閒，别墅偏开荷叶湾。\n郭外沙堤新旧筑，马前云树有无间。\n歌闻花底遥分韵，影识池边近解颜。\n濯魄冰壶谁得似，擎杯坐听水潺潺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23430,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"缺题","author":"屠隆","text":"与欢游池上，荷生满绿池。\n朱花似欢面，素藕似欢肌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23431,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"莲花","author":"李东阳","text":"不见峰头十丈红，别将芳思写江风。\n翠翘金钿明鸾镜，疑是湘妃出水中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23432,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"应制题黄台莲二首 其一","author":"申时行","text":"九疑山下分奇种，百子房中吐瑞姿。\n朵朵黄云团羽盖，为迎金母下瑶池。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23433,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"应制题黄台莲二首 其二","author":"申时行","text":"芙蓉为?菊为裳，高结重台散异香。\n见说君王频问寝，名花长映御袍黄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23434,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"缺题","author":"于若瀛","text":"群英的历点苍苔，朵朵芙蓉并?开。\n只恐西风易零落，殿芳故写岭头梅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23435,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"缺题","author":"丘云霄","text":"轻云疏雨一时来，忽见荷花并?开。\n睡起南薰情思懒，梦深遥过楚王台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23436,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"缺题","author":"丁明登","text":"朝来急雨涌山泉，洗出芙蓉意态妍。\n袅袅数茎欹竹屿，美人和露入淇园。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23437,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"马德沣","author":"丁明登","text":"朵朵红莲映绿池，微风吹动影参差。\n深闺寂寞嫌长昼，一点芳心只自知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23438,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"缺题","author":"许成名","text":"藕花塘上雨霏霏，无数莲房著水垂。\n羞见鸳鸯交颈卧，却将荷叶盖头归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23439,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"缺题","author":"陶安","text":"绝艳莲花水面浮，绿云香湿一沙鸥。\n何时摘取池中叶，驾作中流太乙舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23440,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"镜川先生宅赏白牡丹","author":"李东阳","text":"玉堂天上清，玉版天下白。\n幸从清切地，见此纯正色。\n露苞春始凝，脂萼晓新坼。\n檀深蔼薰心，绛浅微近积。\n终焉保贞素，不涴脂与泽。\n先生无物玩，聊以物自适。\n澹哉君子怀，富贵安可易。\n临轩抚流景，爱此不忍摘。\n我亦惜春心，逢花作花客。\n先生顾客笑，偶此非宿昔。\n客去花未阑，嫣然共今夕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23441,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白牡丹","author":"桑悦","text":"一春无计消繁华，坐香傍色餐流霞。\n妖桃秾李俱小器，揩目晚看花大家。\n素质盈盈美无度，何年谪下瑶台路。\n精神飞入银河篇，体态都归洛神赋。\n神乐观主容台卿，空花压眼真无情。\n吾侪放浪为无事，东风斗酒消春晴。\n曾闻二本归天上，几度重瞳转相向。\n内园点缀黄金屋，禁苑安排紫丝帐。\n朅来此种留人间，托根洞府非尘寰。\n随时穷达花不识，天游何必乘青鸾。\n万事到头俱琐琐，大观万物皆无我。\n半醉题诗谢主人，名花可铸传千古。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23442,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"牡丹","author":"桑悦","text":"尤物开何晚，馀香贮小亭。\n繁华愁日暮，富贵自天成。\n花合隋时宠，根疑宋末生。\n拂衣寻古色，屋角老松青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23443,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"适适园牡丹亭","author":"申时行","text":"洛中移小景，亭北倚新妆。\n题处皆名品，开时正艳阳。\n露凝酣酒色，风度返魂香。\n解道称姚魏，繁华压众芳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23444,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏牡丹","author":"眭石","text":"绣幄拥花王，秾姿斗艳阳。\n枝枝承日彩，片片引天香。\n托植依馀地，含清逐后行。\n独怜春殿里，歌舞侍瑶觞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23445,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东园送白牡丹","author":"吴宽","text":"故园两岁梦鞓红，凤尾花新百种空。\n锦幄未能如富室，瓦盆亦足慰衰翁。\n一枝争卖金钱满，三朵齐开玉盏同。\n独恨春深无暇赏，暮归吹落又狂风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23446,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小园初植牡丹结亭垂就忽放一花时逼长至","author":"申时行","text":"新除药圃结亭台，倾国奇葩忽自开。\n霜后著花还傲菊，春前破萼?输梅。\n韶华岂为三冬借，阳气真从九地回。\n敢谓青皇私绿野，名园桃李暗相猜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23447,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"牡丹","author":"马氏","text":"翠雾红云护短墙，豪华端称作花王。\n洛阳宫里杨妃醉，吴国台前西子妆。\n芳露淡匀腮粉腻，暖风轻度口脂香。\n开时亦自知珍重，静镇东风白昼长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23448,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画牡丹","author":"李东阳","text":"彩毫和露写名花，紫艳分明出魏家。\n应是洛阳归梦远，缁尘红土半京华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23449,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"牡丹初开奭奂张幕以护","author":"吴宽","text":"春深喜见一样红，翠幕高张日正中。\n为语两郎须记取，爱身当与爱花同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23450,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岁寒亭前牡丹谢","author":"储瓘","text":"眼看春去减秾华，倚槛依依影共斜。\n开向省中犹不赏，错将飘泊怨天涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23451,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白牡丹","author":"陆树声","text":"洛阳春色画图中，幻出天然夺化工。\n不泥繁华竞红紫，一般清艳领东风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23452,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"二色牡丹 其一","author":"王衡","text":"宫云朵朵映朝霞，百宝栏前斗丽华。\n卯酒未消红玉面，薄施檀粉伴梅花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23453,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"二色牡丹 其二","author":"王衡","text":"洛阳女儿红颜饶，血色罗裙宝抹腰。\n借得霓裳半庭月，居然管领百花朝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23454,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"摊破浣溪沙","author":"陈继儒","text":"晏起还嗔中酒时，玉牌分得牡丹枝。\n花下自调新乐府，写乌丝。\n付与紫衣传别院，夜来翻入管弦吹。\n赚得老夫重醉也，有情痴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23455,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浪淘沙","author":"李东阳","text":"春去有馀春，且付花神，天香满地不沾尘。\n报道夜来新雨过，雨过还新。\n芳意比佳人，谁写花真，碧云为盖草为茵。\n刚道花王谁不信，疑是前身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23456,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"海棠","author":"张祥鸢","text":"好鸟啼春昼，晴云护草堂。\n日高忘盥栉，天暖减衣裳。\n洗砚抄花谱，钩帘看海棠。\n阑干閒徒倚，巢燕落泥香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23457,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"海棠","author":"吴国伦","text":"仙署名花海国移，半开风雨倍含姿。\n红妆向客寒犹腻，翠幔留春艳不支。\n欹侧漫同妃子醉，婆娑解乞沈郎诗。\n梁园多少青阳景，妒煞君家赤玉枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23458,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"海棠","author":"张祥鸢","text":"花朝曾与故人期，夜敞柴关迟所思。\n小阁忆君同倚处，曲栏怜我独凭时。\n望中落日青丝骑，梦里东风琼树枝。\n可是海棠如有待，春分犹自著花迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23459,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题秋海棠","author":"王士骐","text":"是花偏灼灼，开处几丛丛。\n弱质不禁露，幽怀欲诉风。\n空庭聊取媚，傍石若为容。\n黄菊纷相应，餐英未许同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23460,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏秋海棠","author":"钟惺","text":"墙壁固吾分，烟霜亦是恩。\n光轻偏到蒂，命薄幸馀根。\n笑泣谁能喻，荣衰不敢论。\n年年秋色下，幽独自相存。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23461,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏秋海棠 其一","author":"俞琬纶","text":"薄罗初试怯风凄，小样红妆著雨低。\n一段妖娆描不就，非关子美不能诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23462,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题辛夷花","author":"陈淳","text":"东风日夜发，桃李不禁吹。\n检点浓华事，辛夷落较迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23463,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"木笔","author":"李东阳","text":"泚露和烟晓未乾，多情独自倚栏干。\n春风为报真消息，不是江郎梦里看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23464,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉兰","author":"张茂吴","text":"千花红紫艳阳看，素质摇光独立难。\n但有一枝堪比玉，何须九畹始徵兰。\n唐昌的的春犹浅，汉掌亭亭露欲漙。\n几曲后庭传乐府，张星和月正阑干。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23465,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄山玉兰","author":"方大冶","text":"深谷名花何处移，森森玉树媚清漪。\n国真漫拟猗兰操，香色还同冰雪姿。\n山气凝寒开独后，灵根穿石意偏奇。\n与君采折?琼佩，独笑傍人应未知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23466,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉兰","author":"王谷祥","text":"皎皎玉兰花，不受缁尘垢。\n莫漫比辛夷，白贲谁能偶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23467,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题玉兰","author":"沈周","text":"翠条多力引风长，点破银花玉雪香。\n韵友自知人意好，隔帘轻解白霓裳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23468,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉兰","author":"陈淳","text":"花开不是辛夷种，自得凝香绕紫苞。\n昨夜月明庭下看，恍疑罗袖拂琼瑶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23469,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"绣毬花","author":"于若瀛","text":"春色变园姿，虚亭袅烟雾。\n绿萼间琼朵，团团低入户。\n一夜折繁枝，凄凄风雨妒。\n错落水晶毬，苔痕杂委露。\n凌晨发永叹，踟蹰伤延伫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23470,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"绣毬","author":"陈淳","text":"东风吹琪树，幻出冰雪姿。\n虚亭落清影，夜半月明时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23471,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"绣毬","author":"张新","text":"散作千花簇作团，玲珑如琢巧如攒。\n风来似欲拟明月，好与三郎醉后看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23472,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"紫薇","author":"潘允哲","text":"种自金华省，分来竹素堂。\n蟠枝凝瑞露，接叶逗清光。\n不向仙郎伴，还移野老傍。\n三秋花烂漫，相迟一飞觞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23473,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏栀子花","author":"黄朝荐","text":"兰叶春以荣，桂华秋露滋。\n何如炎炎天，挺此冰雪姿。\n松柏有至性，岂必岁寒时。\n幽香无断续，偏于静者私。\n解酲试新茗，梦㢠理残棋。\n宁肯媚晚凉，清风匝地随。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23474,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"栀子 其一","author":"陈淳","text":"薝卜花开日，园林香雾浓。\n要从花里去，雨后自扶筇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23475,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"栀子 其二","author":"陈淳","text":"薝卜含妙香，来自天竺国。\n笑杀葵与榴，空斯好颜色。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23476,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"薝卜","author":"王谷祥","text":"六出吐奇葩，风清香自远。\n树如天竺林，人在瑶华馆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23477,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏佛桑","author":"桑悦","text":"南无丽卉斗猩红，净土门传到此中。\n欲供如来嫌色重，谓藏宣圣讶枝同。\n叶深似有慈云拥，蕊坼偏惊慧日烘。\n赏玩何妨三宿恋，只愁烧破太虚空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23478,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜合花二绝 其一","author":"李东阳","text":"夜合枝头别有春，坐含风露入清晨。\n任他明月能相照，敛尽芳心不向人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23479,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜合花二绝 其二","author":"李东阳","text":"袂掩芳尘欲避春，羞将月夕换风晨。\n向来花品看应熟，不待开时已可人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23480,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"缺题","author":"王野","text":"远游消息断天涯，燕子空能到妾家。\n春色不知人独自，庭前开遍合欢花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23481,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"缺题","author":"陈继儒","text":"梅雨晴时处处蛙，寻常家酿不须赊。\n老亲醉后盘餐散，瓶里初开夜合花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23482,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小园看芙蓉","author":"申时行","text":"西园试咏邺中词，正及朱华冒绿池。\n绰约偏多临水态，逍遥独抱拒霜姿。\n吴姬晓镜临妆早，楚客霞裳集锦迟。\n最爱秋江留晚色，尽教白首醉琼卮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23483,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芙蓉","author":"谢迁","text":"傍水施朱意自真，幽栖非是避芳尘。\n已呼晚菊为兄弟，更为秋江作主人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23484,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题桂花","author":"陈淳","text":"金粟花开日，天香散玉墀。\n嫦娥解人意，折赠最高枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23485,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桂花","author":"沈周","text":"高攀才子沾衣绿，争插佳人压鬓黄。\n谁向蟾宫分得种，年来人月满庭芳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23486,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"木犀","author":"文嘉","text":"黄金官阙郁嵯峨，万斛清芬散绮罗。\n吴下高枝原有种，天香莫怪属君多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23487,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"缺题","author":"张新","text":"金风飘处识天香，清影分明载魄光。\n莫向高枝轻易折，须知红是状元郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23488,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山茶","author":"于若瀛","text":"丹砂点雕蕊，经月独含苞。\n既足风前态，还宜雪里娇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23489,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山茶 其一","author":"陈淳","text":"丹葩间碧叶，雪中自重叠。\n山人倚醉时，奈可映赪颊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23490,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山茶 其二","author":"陈淳","text":"穷冬多雪霰，柔脆已先摧。\n不是丹砂质，宁能醉后开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23491,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白山茶","author":"沈周","text":"犀甲凌寒碧叶重，玉杯擎处露华浓。\n何当借寿长生酒，只恐茶仙未肯容。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23492,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"红山茶","author":"沈周","text":"老叶经寒壮岁华，猩红点点雪中葩。\n愿希葵藿倾忠胆，岂是争妍富贵家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23493,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨妃茶","author":"张新","text":"曾将倾国比名花，别有轻红晕脸霞。\n自是太真多异色，品题兼得重山茶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23494,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]